@startuml
title Saga-хореография — успешное оформление заказа
autonumber
actor Buyer as B
participant "Order Service" as O
queue Kafka as K
participant "Payment Service" as P
participant "Payment provider" as PP
participant "Delivery Service" as D
participant "Logistics provider" as LP
participant "Notification Service" as N

B -> O: POST /orders (idempotency key)
activate O
O -> O: Создать заказ + OrderCreated в outbox\nодной транзакцией
O -> K: publish OrderCreated
deactivate O
K -> P: OrderCreated
activate P
P -> PP: Провести оплату
PP --> P: Успех
P -> K: PaymentSucceeded
deactivate P
K -> D: PaymentSucceeded
activate D
D -> LP: Создать доставку
LP --> D: Доставка создана
D -> K: DeliveryCreated
deactivate D
K -> O: PaymentSucceeded + DeliveryCreated
activate O
O -> O: Заказ = confirmed + OrderConfirmed в outbox
O -> K: OrderConfirmed
deactivate O
par уведомление
 K -> N: OrderConfirmed
 N -> N: Уведомить продавца
else проекция истории
 note right of K: В Task2 событие также\nпотребляет History Projection Service
end
@enduml
